        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "exclamation + 啊",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Sentence-final 啊 adds feeling to an exclamation or response. The sentence supplies the information; 啊 supplies the expressive tone.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这里真好啊！",
                "pinyin": "zhèlǐ zhēn hǎo a ！",
                "meaning": "It is really lovely here!",
                "audio": "f976b5cd84cae7f0aa78dc97daf693db2ce9e1d2cd850790d0145cdcbfaf48b0"
              },
              {
                "text": "好啊，我们一起去。",
                "pinyin": "hǎo a ， wǒmen yīqǐ qù 。",
                "meaning": "Great, let us go together.",
                "audio": "dcd249c8229a1039babca703b31ea9cb0de0179c3f63ddff6ae14755c619deaa"
              }
